<title>JAPAN: Sanyo Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sanyo Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p>			six months		    four months</p>
<p> Sales		554.12		vs	  334.22</p>
<p> Operating	    7.52		vs	    2.05</p>
<p> Current	     13.89		vs	    6.71</p>
<p> Net		    7.36		vs	    4.48</p>
<p> EPS		    3.77 yen	  vs	    2.30 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   1.95 billion	  vs	1.95 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	     1.70yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Sanyo Electric Co Ltd's comparison above is</p>
<p>figures for the last full business term which only had</p>
<p>four months. Half-term figures for that business term</p>
<p>were not available.</p>
